        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dearest public, welcome to the feline circus!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/73d96a68b14777fd7c107061a12bd99b.avif?t=1784655036\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this circus, a cat alone is capable of handling a whole spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/f322d1fee1771bb4eedf21901acb53d1.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/f322d1fee1771bb4eedf21901acb53d1.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player has to press the corresponding commands following the rhythm of the song to guarantee the best show possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Show your rhythm skills and coordination to impress the human audience that is excited to see your tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/e2d31f258ce8bfa887dd13e5980ed7fa.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/e2d31f258ce8bfa887dd13e5980ed7fa.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/e2d31f258ce8bfa887dd13e5980ed7fa.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(But don’t worry if you get anything wrong, those humans are very comprehensive).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare your cat for the show</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can customize your cat, changing its color, eyes, or even picking between one of the clothing options available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/a3a201f256781469c6858330b66db9b5.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/a3a201f256781469c6858330b66db9b5.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/a3a201f256781469c6858330b66db9b5.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Exclusive acts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are over 20 songs specially made for this spectacle, each with 3 difficulty levels. Either if you don't have any rhythm or if you're the embodiment of a metronome, you can have fun with it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">See the big top evolving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you keep the combo sequence going, not only the points multiplier increases but also the environment gets filled with lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dearest public, welcome to the feline circus!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/73d96a68b14777fd7c107061a12bd99b.avif?t=1784655036\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In this circus, a cat alone is capable of handling a whole spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/f322d1fee1771bb4eedf21901acb53d1.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/f322d1fee1771bb4eedf21901acb53d1.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player has to press the corresponding commands following the rhythm of the song to guarantee the best show possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Show your rhythm skills and coordination to impress the human audience that is excited to see your tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/e2d31f258ce8bfa887dd13e5980ed7fa.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/e2d31f258ce8bfa887dd13e5980ed7fa.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/e2d31f258ce8bfa887dd13e5980ed7fa.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(But don’t worry if you get anything wrong, those humans are very comprehensive).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Prepare your cat for the show</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can customize your cat, changing its color, eyes, or even picking between one of the clothing options available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/a3a201f256781469c6858330b66db9b5.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/a3a201f256781469c6858330b66db9b5.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/a3a201f256781469c6858330b66db9b5.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Exclusive acts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There are over 20 songs specially made for this spectacle, each with 3 difficulty levels. Either if you don't have any rhythm or if you're the embodiment of a metronome, you can have fun with it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/00dd87d78094368bd86265233f64291b.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">See the big top evolving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you keep the combo sequence going, not only the points multiplier increases but also the environment gets filled with lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.poster.avif?t=1784655036\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.webm?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590590/extras/4eec690ccd818814a5a543871f94f417.mp4?t=1784655036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
